${C_BOLD}Usage:${C_RESET} suitehive upgrade [--version <tag>] [--backup] [--yes]

Upgrades a running install:
  1. offers to take a backup first (--backup: always, --yes without --backup: skip)
  2. sets SH_VERSION in .env when --version is given
  3. refreshes docker-compose.yml, Caddyfile and initdb/ from the release
     (.env is kept; your previous files are kept as .bak)
  4. pulls the images (for --build installs: git pull in src/ and rebuild)
  5. restarts changed containers and waits until auth is healthy

Templates come from the branch in \$SH_REF (default main).
